Trip Advisory is a simple and user-friendly travel website that helps users explore destinations and plan their trips.

🏖️ Discover popular tourist destinations.

🌦️ Get travel tips and weather information.

🏨 Explore places to visit and nearby attractions.

📱 Enjoy a responsive design using HTML and CSS.

Technologies Used: HTML, CSS

Purpose: To make travel planning easier, more enjoyable, and convenient for everyone.
